      "id": "claim_1311bde23f634fc0aa3ffa2720da972a",
      "statement": "GitHub login issues signed state carrying a hashed nonce stored in a short-lived state cookie and redirects to GitHub; the normal callback validates it, exchanges the code, enforces the organization gate, persists the token, and issues a signed session cookie, while a desktop handoff returns a PKCE-bound code without setting that browser cookie.",
